Vendored model: ECAPA-TDNN speaker embedding
=============================================

This directory contains a redistributed copy of the pretrained SpeechBrain
ECAPA-TDNN speaker-embedding model, vendored so VoiceLock can compute
voiceprints fully offline (no runtime network; loaded with HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1).

