Vendored files
--------------
- hyperparams.yaml        SpeechBrain load recipe (defines the pretrainer)
- embedding_model.ckpt    ECAPA-TDNN embedding network weights
- mean_var_norm_emb.ckpt  global embedding normalization stats
- classifier.ckpt         VoxCeleb speaker classifier head (loaded by the recipe)
- label_encoder.txt       speaker label mapping (loaded by the recipe)
- config.json             model config metadata

VoiceLock uses only the speaker-embedding path (embedding_model +
mean_var_norm_emb); classifier.ckpt and label_encoder.txt are retained
because the official hyperparams.yaml pretrainer loads them.

